            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 style="color:rgb(38,26,99)" class="accordion-title---solutions">1. How can I equip my restaurant with Innovorder?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0)" alt src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" loading="lazy" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">At Innovorder, we do everything we can to make your experience as smooth as possible.<br><br>But the easiest way is to make an appointment with an expert advisor, visit our showroom and discover all our solutions. Together, we'll define the solution best suited to your needs. And if you can't make it to the showroom, a phone call is all it takes to lay the foundations for our future collaboration.<br><br>Then we'll make an appointment to install our solutions on site, train you and make sure you're ready to get your business off the ground!<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d2003211-f9dee215" data-w-id="2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d2003211" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 style="color:rgb(38,26,99)" class="accordion-title---solutions">2.  Is Innovorder right for my restaurant?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0)" alt src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" loading="lazy" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Whatever the size of your establishment or structure, Innovorder is designed for both fast food and commercial catering (independent, franchise, food court, dark kitchen, etc.) and institutional catering (SRC, self-managed).<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d200321b-f9dee215" data-w-id="2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d200321b" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 style="color:rgb(38,26,99)" class="accordion-title---solutions">3. What's included in the price?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0)" alt src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" loading="lazy" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">No unpleasant surprises!<br><br>Our turnkey solution includes: hardware, license, installation, maintenance, unlimited updates and regular follow-up by a dedicated account manager.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_9f2f5139-742f-522f-eb7c-02eacd63d13a-f9dee215" data-w-id="9f2f5139-742f-522f-eb7c-02eacd63d13a" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 style="color:rgb(38,26,99)" class="accordion-title---solutions">4. Is Innovorder synchronized with my favorite applications?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0)" alt src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" loading="lazy" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Innovorder interfaces with the most popular restaurant applications: Uber Eats, Splio, Stripe, Combo, Stuart, etc. And to provide you with an even richer offering, we're continually expanding our catalog of integrations.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_093ea793-f397-54e9-115a-19c535af18e3-f9dee215" data-w-id="093ea793-f397-54e9-115a-19c535af18e3" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 style="color:rgb(38,26,99)" class="accordion-title---solutions">5. I'm still with L'Addition, how do I switch my ecosystem to Innovorder?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0)" alt src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" loading="lazy" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">We propose a specific offer to easily migrate your L'Addition equipment to Innovorder. A simple request to an Innovorder consultant is all it takes.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_962375fb-b321-769b-c2c5-becf25ed7dc4-f9dee215" data-w-id="962375fb-b321-769b-c2c5-becf25ed7dc4" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 style="color:rgb(38,26,99)" class="accordion-title---solutions">6. When does NF 525 certification become compulsory for restaurateurs?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0)" alt src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" loading="lazy" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">NF 525 certification will become compulsory from January 1, 2026 for all restaurateurs using a POS system. This is a legal requirement aimed at combating tax fraud.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_95861a70-05b6-4749-6964-84024d98215f-f9dee215" data-w-id="95861a70-05b6-4749-6964-84024d98215f" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 style="color:rgb(38,26,99)" class="accordion-title---solutions">7. Are all Innovorder cash registers NF 525 certified?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0)" alt src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" loading="lazy" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, Innovorder cash register software has been NF 525 certified for 10 years. This guarantees that it complies with all legal obligations in terms of security, archiving and inalterability of checkout data. So you're fully compliant.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_9bc48ac9-f7f5-4a7d-f742-f5ba1a2ce902-f9dee215" data-w-id="9bc48ac9-f7f5-4a7d-f742-f5ba1a2ce902" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 style="color:rgb(38,26,99)" class="accordion-title---solutions">8. What does a restaurateur risk if he is inspected without an NF 525-certified cash register?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0)" alt src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" loading="lazy" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Using a non-certified cash register after the law has come into force could result in fines, non-compliance, or even tax penalties in the event of an audit. We advise you to anticipate and adopt a compliant solution today to avoid any unnecessary risk.<br></div>
            </div>
